  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "君孤獨處，單弱無輔。名曰困苦，輔心湧泉。碌碌如山。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cf024b0044bfb36640021c3508b435ea6f27c57e4ea1413c00773ca1bf7a3424",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d5e3e174cc865b58f2b47ddde9ca0abdf69104f747de2ea7f4af575cf7718cfd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "憂驚已深，禍不為災，安全以來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:28404885d05bf8738789142f9589cf100dd31b882f1d26a7db2d6e318e86712d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d7505de51f4431fbf130700caae3669b1426a3cdb3ce5354b1e3c19fcbd862e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "穿匏浥水，搆鐵熒火。勞疲力竭，飢渴為禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c54b0f35b6185eb5d485b3db1c984bd7564b601b185b6bcb54ded6cec194c8e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:62bbc6ff7c07ab19e35c7fa60c6a7e1516a47c0663a84a37bbd60907eea00bd6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "蹇牛折角，不能載粟。災害不避，年歲無穀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a8f94ba1d60d1d0c9bca8f7d46bf2c3631901a023cc7c765be9b1c2fdf73b67a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fe5ef26d22fee5c08718bb12246c6d4b364c4f2fb98c374db571117b1181c2ea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "邑將為墟，居之憂危。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:af350fb100fc9a7f76b777ae43ccc2de2c526d6fbd696afa0b0fb907e64a3c93",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f9104a1f2fc5eaa6568d89a4baa9893faed31aec68701b67d6fc3f898086914f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "根刖樹殘，花葉落去。卒逢火焱，隨風僵仆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bc0c93339055272285e94748635da3c4198035513347db764f915558dd9d875d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ebc959191ce7bbf6f18917a50d9767043794877dbff20d1f50493d6627ac87b9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "元后貪欲，窮極民力。執政乖劣，為夷所覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7b11bd131d8c78e9068f0d206c3214ae9f05f78bd39a8f26f1dfb0b7c0720973",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7bc1c79146d466b18e85dde6f6a8aaec61f5490c828eade62e268b6b69bb1524"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "北山有黍，使叔壽考。東嶺多粟，宜行賈市。陸梁雄雉，所至利喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f088a7e40f2374a83aa1c8765159e791937318889ce8821db519921be1b2799",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1aa817ac3005f74b1c52a200ccc82d995fedd7b0287a1bf1e30b92b9676f81eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "高原峻山，陸土少泉。草木林麓，嘉禾所災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e707d66f0da555e5a7b35c74f1fefb6ec21780fc9365a7888744b89bced33cbf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:66affa16551c508116a82be402550b7960b48dbb688ee6a7bb37ca3be29c536c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "辰次降婁，王駕巡狩。廣施德惠，國安無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:da019d13a244e2263276d94438f7c47f23c21ac613d83e0c69f3431900de6d2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:734891003c9fec4c0ad41b746e4d19e84c0be3f6a046c033dbb89af1797e7586"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "軥軥轠轠，歲暮偏弊。寵名復棄，君衰於位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7634020b03e49be2f630128afbf676aadeef443d485f07f227bb321c3488428f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3b6aabb728ec6a78d617583c6536ae8d72a044eb899ce3c56b932f282205cb9e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "放銜委轡，奔亂不制。法度無常，君失其位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:55259c8d9d5f9942cd53e080910b4c5c56851170e0de811244868e00a96ed0cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c99cc2ef95b76470cceaeb6f357bfe3ba4cef2ac76224f3450ccb0b6d765f268"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "獨登西垣，莫與笑言。秋風多哀，使我心悲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02e90adc2e53f32fb7da2452c3c61c0027d3867f43c18e4c5773c235c8093eb8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0e426d87ad895f2119a2c9cc253d85612d51844bd805da1601a30e54e00de733"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "脛急股攣，不可出門。暮速群旅，必為身患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f7c29cb9b832c61df39013d07b2e598706f99b587bb3099fa7f2c84d7462f457",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dfe0328a857d63f2794a1873f5c7ab4b66b19320794ad3397c41053673270d38"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "情偽難知，使我偏頗。小人在位，雖聖何咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a5ed10cf654acd7386107955590c731572818c3b255f7c11b2df2549e2927e5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f0e9ac6817d14373df16e35bfc63563f2976eb407dc051236390a3a845c74dca"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "黍稷醇醲，敬奉山宗。神嗜飲食，甘雨嘉祥。庶物蕃茂，時無災咎，獨蒙福祉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ffdb909f2cccb705394cf41348c253d49d4f69cadc590809f1a6a4228dd91d5f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bec39b837d527a303f3885e65818cee04d7679475573d40566423bf2c789bf48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "公子王孫，把彈攝丸。發輒有獲，室家饒足。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:85b47583f70ccf7f4970e5ecd6e2069fd85690b4e740be739c2574cc63c025f6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b5b210956168dd3a8422c028f873e672be48ca9fe8a6e9788fb959db0e068fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "陰升陽伏，舜失其室。元元赤子，相餒不食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:78edbd4b4ddd47d778726772d8b53b1d5935b03a3ebe8673a03c2dcc5294a9b1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f10dd8dd7d8552a7e6b12f9980091af4d14bc1d73e417e20982fc6ceaae42ad7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "七竅龍身，造易八元。法天則地，順時施恩。引和貴長，以富永存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:62c2360b173fc5ca10f7016209d629fb90f8e6080f46d0c9f76358fffbce2a5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1383a6a37007538624a216fbb7d0cb9afaaac3bc31b2f7c32027ba9d998578d4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "逐狐東山，水遏我前。深不可涉，失利後便。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0458a00787e3a9b27df1f755b508b25dfd1d3055b880c8b0198abd9505afb6cf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e41d77104e8486e8482f01e6abf600ff1cff96661e18a805f5a448abf3a9fdda"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "銜命辱使，不堪其事。中墜落去，更為負載。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9eb6181b2ac5ecb3b03c66a574eead2d6fef5f59723db525c42a03bcfc7304ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ec59c4dbf4c8433e54da4e0e0683bf2b617e0d6c04579b16d839630ca059413d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "溫仁君子，忠孝所在。八閏為儀，禍災不起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7ee06d915507cd294fd838016e5ecfdc3f806b523d710f41d8cfd8f72c0faabb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bc02d20c6dd9203c925cff670764f1cc45e0ae688f4bd394f567a19087b8d2fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "春多膏澤，夏潤優渥。稼穡熟成，數獲百斛。師行以律，霸功不遠。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:16baa6f9a735ddd0967d91d3d7c1a193dc28a4e69b00a2cdbe9e3db1fa1d642b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dede79efafa025cd7e90599f5bb39bc1446a46fc322747d8ada389d5750445a6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "二女同室，心不聊食。首髮如蓬，憂常在中。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b8af87f63c6bbb25be6940ca77da43180d2e125ab4c37b48898e1b11e6ffc7c4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b75b1c1e993d01ac65eaed58031e565a1f72b85c4278bef952041ffc45054442"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "築闕石顛，立本泉源。病疾不安，老孤為鄰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:190e5211fe4d859aa757a681c1aa778962b4ead160c11566291500bece28c8a5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c400cedb3bba60b2693b966a6881f26341ddc11b8f9cb90aa35f1aad982b5049"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "欲避凶門，反與禍鄰。顛覆不制，痛薰我心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1eb78623db95521e428bb80c36fed9616aeb43043a341d7a7f661610ffbd893b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b917bb7cccf59e8e37a3c50b23c08f7b123e93a395d0ad6c5cc09da41a99a771"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "踧行竊視，有所畏避。狸首伏藏，以夜為利。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:45f1db1e958728b3fe1517b721fc99aa7ef7495b0c0660385f92acbbf1e82ee5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4f5bf514a53b02338827cecb7193712b5fc342ced236c0730855960891623151"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "人面鬼口，長舌為斧。斲破瑚璉，殷商絕後。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fdea9c48940ad639408e8be3032fd54305f73259e1dc99234d2b15d938f3292b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1f5077598e84b978770f5251c4ca6eb137041bf8ec56e1a3c1c39a9677d70f72"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "和氣相薄，膏澤津液，生我嘉穀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2f3a6905dfd4b82ce285926e8209b3a943e24eebf89f5ad0d5b180b9e58d2e48",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7546cc0b7cb57e8ca4f53754257b66cdc194a5605b88ec89807ac29d2ac54ad"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "銷金鑄兵，雷車不行，民安其鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3af8171ec0365d079d4c903f9bde3a76b1d9e73dddc0597e3e6f03c4bac9ed27",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4dd3edce24e1c8f0de851ac3967a6c18f32d6661e9697d486ce24f508b7f3b71"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "秦儀機言，解其國患。一說燕下，齊相以權。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:17a9c961f563d41a5047e8cc8c9b0ef427d84ac13d547f0281ed22e212cc5bae",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2fb6510c25db04facd206d6e005b10a0b64f57970d1b7d716ab41cd82fae79a1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "旦奭輔王，周德孔明。越裳獻雉，萬國咸寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:763cedc96f160507c4109997b32a1dc0e9f14bbf5911f6e6abc5071e1a1671c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d1266f429dc011c333c64447312483324cb9e3bb432d0451c08bfacd3d0ccbb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "弱足刖跟，不利出門。賈市無過，折亡為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d9a4cd323fc841936ab42f182c02787c1604ef4acb63c9a17e6f0f8695bcd83e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d65892ac23327d9a92148270afb45a217890d092492565cf3f03d70b8a6c114"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "堅冰黃鳥，常哀悲愁。不見甘粒，但睹藜蒿。數驚鷙鳥，為我心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f39815a2a398c00131a72bcc7476bb2234d5db4c9ccd89f35234553e68723649",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e76854eb4dfec1bf32c09ad1348f134b0d00c0f9ee5d0f3ef9dfc8d3edecd4f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "魂微惙惙，屬纊聽絕。豁然大通，復更生活。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:07b4639708caebc3bf7e0223b624ea68f908835ddec257d4b035bd2ee71973da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f32e5a04f74e5c5be95aa5605348e89068509c75f1d70fcf9fded625ec4cd0be"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "陰生麞鹿，鼠舞鬼谷。靈龜陸處。（一云：靈鼠陸處，鬼哭鼠舞。）釜甑草土。人知敗國，桀亂無緒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:acb9296397d894281a92fcd258c7427e063372f219d010eef4c529a54dd26007",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fbb6214983d490a4a78f2131022f90c9e93a22fb4365ab6b306fd8c67d2895b8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "鑿諸攻玉，無不穿鑿。龍體吾舉，魯班為輔。舞鳳成形，德象君子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:283ccdc183ea5a19bde7ae193215061e78c5341d8dea5e21e8070584548a9859",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:03f76d311b35c6deaf3839dc81465ba972257d25ce9599835699dc5a72bd4706"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "山作天時，陸為海口，民不安處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d09c9428883a3d57e51f45354ef6a86b3f994dc99ef1b238de3c5fadb5f96f40",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bebe9a72400c160c42e5baa05f2699f92aacadfde1c05c415d7a73581a50c33b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "東風啟戶，隱伏懽喜。萌庶蒙恩，復得我子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9db2706ff7f33a1fc66007e81c3d8c56efbe9a363340e5691c9dd7c414f51965",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3251002b5330ed9eb4c528d3675b7b6f1b95259123f2639b80e5ea426fedc2ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "華燈百枝，植暗衰微。精光欲盡，命如灰麋。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:79c84c714789d0afeadb80d265212297aef2fc00ff1bf45453b4e0fe9c65bdbe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab1510729f8bef2618d6fcfef66645b244649c340e9ac796724dc41d1d13329b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "三十無室，寄伯桑中。上宮長女，不得樂同。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f6e2cc06e1acd7d700abe194d6be3af52bcdf4082f34d180705ddde2c0f09b4c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f39e7b3daea74b1a54865412652316449e71f4b0ad4c7aceae3de163cc4a6db3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "卵與石鬥，糜碎無處。動而有悔，出不得時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eb7ef102155330b231fe1d3e95d8aff844eaf991ef4ccff43da07ac13f369c2d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e0fe8a39c6156d79ac8ac94a15cc78ab6e41aa8a025c8af42b5144661731e3d7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "尋兵爭強，失其貞良，敗我殽鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7bb41898bf1962deff6e49c1df7a413c40fd477fb4186d4359e18c556ff312d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6649de23ae95953f842ce449741b46be50b185ba30e8d8d07079493037503065"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "虐除善疑，難為攻醫。驥窮鹽車，困於御御。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b177d72056fa72cb69a10fd9973481f7798c10661b95ee234399d20c7017864",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78e7fd4a0d8d1fbbf3cda4424acad8928839a987e63be279a00bb5999ffadd89"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "操笱搏狸，荷弓射魚。非其器用，自令心勞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40a3c6eedd4a4bc7d0eb457fb82182d73d1c6e1e08497e64c2f58084a5f0ea36",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d195b9e28d713c30b2deb04ea1c197fc2513a7ae83e6d937aa755462bbb77285"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "葵丘之盟，獻晉會庭。見太宰辭，後秦還興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f4daced0fa6225427c1e8237e28313eeac507548c82b796e166567df1ff95299",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7eb2ca877817ece3dbac7cc6fc83bd49e15c1d031bcd623b795ab4f664ffe8c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "臏詐龐子，夷竈書木。伏兵卒發，矢至如雨。魏師驚亂，將獲為虜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5faca76cc76f7586192e952a416599feebd9013081123e5f1a48f7842036d3c7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c0c4d5c8a41884b4add2ab3804b1bfcd7b6f5c37c059c9e22f2fba8fbfc144a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "南行出城，世得大福。王姬歸齊，賴其所欲。以安邦國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0adbb5de3ca8932751c08ca933254a1b5aa2ce6b02101898c33d5eb221383508",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6b083898d9629d40606e8eda029113d2e92d07737848c71333e0c853b85466da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "冬采薇蘭，地凍堅難。雖利奔走，暮無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9bacea48b46934a1db46fa29736390cfc9ec177b1be8843bdb865d5764663bb7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90cba63f1f77636282d56b81c9180be532c90c6768e169b5b559ee5376731867"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "王喬無病，狗頭不痛。亡破失履，乏我欲速。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:04f5f93d6341fba1fab7a30f9ffb1a94a591296f94738a037ec90f58fe2e2a8d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:da338f4a52b9954b7686246dcc331aea83e0908f0d01a44f0dc4444505e56948"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "宛馬疾步，盲師坐御。自不見路，中止弗到。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:97a4346a96e82695508d13b4388a4d915a5aab282fcf6a673ed1a93191e443b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:029a430fc0c468f62f2851fb9a4292faa8af97218a6e8ceff2f5b4d1fe9ee323"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "求我難國，亡去我北。憂歸其城，反為我賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4d81170d02405dd86d03bf80ee650c9688d704f757e534ef8e68f02343e99d43",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e600e88f4de52e2c0b1ac4bf6a36d13586c0b454f30947c8735b9581faa86fb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "比目四翼，安我邦國。上下無思，為我嘉福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f8e942faf49759159cb351a67126194368dfa163ffbaf073a7775cb338ed28e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ea47beb2f8869d19c3288f2ee2f936b88c0f70899d6d70caf1181e6b6555c99"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "八材既登，以成嘉功。龍降庭堅，國無災凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:caa249e4e81b229862c8f445b3714b3999aeb3359ed73bb0783932fbe59b86e4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:127380c5be434e5ec015fa2682f31e50e3812218e88db91530c8ff72745e1ba0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "消弊穿空，家莫為宗。奴婢逃走，子西父東。為身作凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d075a6e10516825923ec833bf7edec3cc77c878d5f30dc98abfadfc32bd272a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e1cea225ec2ed96d5f1b5126d7ef4bde3181229e34281d6101e18bc7003ae8b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "鳥舞國城，邑懼卒驚。仁德不修，為下所傾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f7b871a5e682f5e75d9aff43fe7ce987dbc8f8f5c751099c25a5a55e787a8525",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5519ed9f8893b239263fd2d983bed35d886d524a98a9388e3a0120e4ad8fee26"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "五穀不熟，民苦困急。駕之南國，嘉樂有得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:920ecb994509b06ad7e71dbffb3c9b3f54bbbd0e7cdd2dcf8fc35ac650c138ff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:466f4349d06b6e6f69376f106290c22401dd7245fd796cd24790502232b4f88d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "黃裳建元，病得在身。福祐洋溢，封為齊君。賈市無門，富貴多餐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6474e21844371130446abb10eab98074d7407e34d65efc0d0394c6c1fdc7eb9a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:80c06e311062bcf4469a189cbabcb4155087f808f68e7af0e9e98ac28993b7a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "齊東郭廬，嬪於洛都。駿良美好，利得萬倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fc3cc6d7ea31c2c2f1598dc561e787ba27b2629104586fb3d3d355bad773ade7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:892f6d8c95064c84af38f401061bd088d61087744342e57b4c35137f448f6d9b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "安床厚褥，不得失宿。棄我嘉宴，困於南國。投杼之憂，不成禍災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f900d6ea3d2120dfb10c291856a41090f5eb649951c6ac8b47954126d83bbf79",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e45a276e0dd0142179aa602d5f46dd9a5d24d34590f5d3db4c7730dbbc27b44"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "內崩身傷，中亂無恒。雖有美粟，不得其食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:57621cabeb6082cfc29bf72963fbb496e024fe74b91e50f889b5aea440350241",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:47b06c4a73f39747b41031f0ec26168a68ce815f892c54aeb51a05e825b56739"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "出門逢患，與禍為怨。更有拏刺，傷我指端。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c5efcc0325f97745c820e43aef2d220de18404259aabcd9c283e50745487269d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:417ae96b76ddad017ec08c541972c80e22f9e9cfdb527ed9659dc7de84e52a9a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "出入節持，南北無憂。行者即至，在外歸來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c984e3955d6d719a8d70891bcb5fb245f655191dd4d400aca2403fb300cbc20a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:25a02e5b53523d716bb1a5d7672b74e87dc6520bb290fadc3310006df0b91bcf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 52,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "公孫駕車，載遊東齊。延陵說產，遺季紵衣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:17b2c05efe9e7c46fc9b7285219e4fac84c1a8778e28bb16763275c54c53cedf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:751790d594985a54c96b3011c7779acd934590a659d653a3416ac51c7e441b2e"
    }
  ]
}
